{"title":"Large Hadron Couture Collider","link":"https://kottke.org/25/06/large-hadron-couture-collider","date":1751313984000,"content":"\n        <p><a href=\"https://www.irisvanherpen.com/\">Iris van Herpen</a> has an on-going collaboration with CERN. The Dutch fashion designer’s latest project, with <a href=\"https://www.nickknight.com/\">photographer Nick Knight</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DLcZUubsd_h/\">takes place in the Compact Muon Solenoid experiment</a>, which is maybe the most sci-fi looking thing on Earth.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/iris-van-herpen-cern.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/iris-van-herpen-cern.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/iris-van-herpen-cern.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1626\" alt=\"a model poses in front of a huge and very complicated scientific apparatus\" /></p>\n\n<p>(via <a href=\"https://susannahbreslin.com/\">susannah breslin</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/CERN\">CERN</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/fashion\">fashion</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Iris%20van%20Herpen\">Iris van Herpen</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/LHC\">LHC</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Nick%20Knight\">Nick Knight</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/science\">science</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/06/large-hadron-couture-collider\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"0c38dbf1f3c11a3ca7a86f59d48e1e8c167cd324fd2e091b4e721d6d2a1c119d","category":"Sites"}